      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "So many factors in play when it comes to this Crock pot of a mess we call VRChat. Let me explain. You have creators of the world who may or may not optimize it. You have creators of avatars that may or may not optimize it. Then you have the developers of VRChat that may or may not... dare i say it, optimize what ever they are currently working on. Basically with a game... or better yet a \"Social Media\" outlet like this i don't think SLI or Crossfire support is going to do much. My build needs updating but i have a 4790K and 2 1080ti's. Guess what... VRChat is still not where it needs to be. Trust me im not trying to bash your idea @{5c13315057f6093e67a2e7e7|full_name} but i dont see it fixing anything :/ <3",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
