      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The 2020 pandemic has also lent weight to the idea of just re-buying and SLI-ing the same card you already have instead of spending hundreds of dollars (or moping around, given how unobtainable video cards are right now due to bots and scalpers). \nUnity has a free NVIDIA VR-SLI (one card per eye) plugin here: https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/tools/particles-effects/nvidia-vrworks-83505 - if VRChat implemented it I would have no reason to upgrade.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
