  "details": "VRChat is a GPU intensive game. No matter how hard the developer tries, community created contents will always be un-optimized somehow. Even with the latest GPU, the game couldn't even maintain a smooth VR 45fps when a few groups of people are in the same room. I believe some of us are willing to pay for SLI to get higher frame rate.\nI also understand this isn't a high priority problem but since I couldn't find any SLI related request so I opened one here.",
